      "name": "search_courses",
      "description": "Search the Comidoc historical course catalog with topic, quality, freshness, coupon availability, repeat-course, and regular-issuer filters. Coupon capacity and remaining redemptions are always returned when known. Courses with an active coupon carry an access block: what opening the coupon requires, the price with and without it, and the savings. Each course has course_url, its Comidoc course page; coupon codes are not included.",
