    {
      "name": "show_course_cards",
      "description": "Display Comidoc courses as visual cards in clients that support MCP Apps: image, title, instructor, rating, duration, Udemy price and price with the coupon, coupons left, coupon end date, and language. Takes Udemy course IDs or Comidoc slugs, in display order. Each card links to course_url, the Comidoc course page; cards show no coupon code.",
